cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Social Leading VR"
abstract: >-
  A Unity platform for real-time movement coupling between two avatars in
  networked social VR. A share of one user's hands, and optionally position,
  drives another user's avatar. One integrated app lets every person choose
  avatar, role, session, and movement link inside VR.
